From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: a webview asks before its page navigates

A <webview> fires DomicileWillNavigateEvent before its page navigates
its main frame, and the shell cancels the navigation with
preventDefault(), as Electron's will-navigate
(components/domicile/browser/will_navigate_throttle.cc).

This patch carries the parts in files Chromium owns: three lists, so
that `DomicileWillNavigateEvent` is compiled and reaches the page, as
patch 0114 does for dialogs.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_core.gni | 2 ++
 third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_core.gni       | 1 +
 third_party/blink/renderer/core/html/build.gni            | 2 ++
 3 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_core.gni b/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_core.gni
index c700f3c..25ebcd6 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_core.gni
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/generated_in_core.gni
@@ -1222,6 +1222,8 @@ generated_interface_sources_in_core = [
   "$root_gen_dir/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/core/v8/v8_domicile_device_request_event.h",
   "$root_gen_dir/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/core/v8/v8_domicile_dialog_event.cc",
   "$root_gen_dir/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/core/v8/v8_domicile_dialog_event.h",
+  "$root_gen_dir/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/core/v8/v8_domicile_will_navigate_event.cc",
+  "$root_gen_dir/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/core/v8/v8_domicile_will_navigate_event.h",
   "$root_gen_dir/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/core/v8/v8_html_geolocation_element.cc",
   "$root_gen_dir/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/core/v8/v8_html_geolocation_element.h",
   "$root_gen_dir/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/core/v8/v8_html_head_element.cc",
diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_core.gni b/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_core.gni
index 3fc9598..80874bd 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_core.gni
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/bindings/idl_in_core.gni
@@ -468,6 +468,7 @@ static_idl_files_in_core = [
